---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17725550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(772) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Mold Remediation in Fort Pierce, FL | Fort Pierce Mold Specialists" description="Professional mold remediation in Fort Pierce and St. Lucie County. Containment, safe removal, and prevention-focused cleanup.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Mold Remediation in Fort Pierce, FL</h1>
      <p>Professional mold remediation in Fort Pierce and St. Lucie County. Containment, safe removal, and prevention-focused cleanup.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.25rem">Call </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
<h2>Full Mold Remediation</h2>
<p>Remediation is more than wiping surfaces. We isolate the work area, remove contaminated materials, clean remaining surfaces with appropriate methods, and address the moisture source so mold does not return.</p>
<h2>Our Process</h2>
<ul>
<li>Containment to protect the rest of the property</li>
<li>Removal of mold-damaged porous materials when necessary</li>
<li>HEPA vacuuming and detailed cleaning</li>
<li>Antimicrobial treatment where appropriate</li>
<li>Guidance on drying and humidity control</li>
</ul>
<p>We explain the scope and provide a written estimate before work begins. Clearance checks can be arranged after the job when needed.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — </a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
